% A runtime error in a property stops the run: with -json, the report ends
% with an error event, after the property being checked was announced.
accumulate property.

% [bad X Y]: Y is X plus a variable never bound (a runtime error)
pred bad i:int, o:int.
bad X Y :- Y is X + Z_.

property "fine" (pi X\ X = X).
property "crash" (pi X Y\ bad X Y ==> Y = X).
property "never-reached" (pi X\ X = X).
